---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import Image from "astro/components/Image.astro";
import gregWilmot from "../images/greg-wilmot.webp";

---

<Layout>
  <Nav />

  <main>
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="py-32 pt-48 px-4 bg-navy-900 text-center">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6 leading-normal">
          About PrimePoint <span class="text-primary">Health</span> <br>
          <span class="text-primary">Who We Are</span>
        </h1>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Our Vision Section -->
    <section class="py-20 px-4 bg-white">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-8">Our Vision</h2>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          At PrimePoint Health, we envision a healthcare industry that is
          innovative, equitable, and sustainable. We are driven by a passion to
          help organizations deliver exceptional care while adapting to change.
          Our role is to serve as trusted advisors and partners on your journey
          toward excellence, bringing an outside perspective informed by insider
          experience.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Leadership Section -->
    <section class="py-20 pb-4 bg-white">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-center mb-16">
          Leadership
        </h2>
        <p class="text-center text-lg text-navy-900/60 mb-12">
          PrimePoint Health is led by Greg Wilmot, an accomplished healthcare
          executive with over 25 years of experience across healthcare spectrum.
          Greg founded PrimePoint Health to share his strategic leadership
          expertise with organizations striving to improve and grow. His
          background includes:
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="space-y-0">
          <div
            class="group border-t border-navy-900/10 py-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors px-4"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-8">
              <span class="text-sm font-bold text-navy-900/40">⚫</span>
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold">
                President and CEO of a large award-winning FQHC
              </h3>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-4 md:mt-0 max-w-sm text-sm text-navy-900/60">
              Led Massachusetts's largest community health center, serving
              120,000+ patients, and achieved national recognition for quality
              and innovation.
            </div>
            <span
              class="hidden md:block material-icons-outlined text-navy-900/20 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors"
              >north_east</span
            >
          </div>
          <div
            class="group border-t border-navy-900/10 py-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors px-4"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-8">
              <span class="text-sm font-bold text-navy-900/40">⚫</span>
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold">Senior Advisor in Government</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-4 md:mt-0 max-w-sm text-sm text-navy-900/60">
              Drove strategy and performance initiatives at Massachusetts
              Executive Office of Health & Human Services, coordinating policy
              across 16 agencies.
            </div>
            <span
              class="hidden md:block material-icons-outlined text-navy-900/20 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors"
              >north_east</span
            >
          </div>
          <div
            class="group border-t border-navy-900/10 py-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors px-4"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-8">
              <span class="text-sm font-bold text-navy-900/40">⚫</span>
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold">
                Leadership in Health Systems & Insurance
              </h3>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-4 md:mt-0 max-w-sm text-sm text-navy-900/60">
              Held key leadership roles at a major health system and state's
              largest health plan, focusing on innovation, accountable care,
              risk management, and business development.
            </div>
            <span
              class="hidden md:block material-icons-outlined text-navy-900/20 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors"
              >north_east</span
            >
          </div>
          <div
            class="group border-t border-navy-900/10 py-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors px-4"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-8">
              <span class="text-sm font-bold text-navy-900/40">⚫</span>
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold">Industry Recognition</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-4 md:mt-0 max-w-sm text-sm text-navy-900/60">
              Honored as a Top Healthcare Leader (Boston Business Journal's "40
              Under 40", "Power 50 - Movement Maker", "Innovator in Healthcare",
              Becker's "Top Community Hospital CEOs to Know", Modern
              Healthcare's "Top 25 Diversity Leaders", among others) for
              visionary leadership and community impact.
            </div>
            <span
              class="hidden md:block material-icons-outlined text-navy-900/20 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors"
              >north_east</span
            >
          </div>
          <div
            class="group border-t border-navy-900/10 py-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors px-4"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-8">
              <span class="text-sm font-bold text-navy-900/40">⚫</span>
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold">Commitment to Community</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-4 md:mt-0 max-w-sm text-sm text-navy-900/60">
              Served on various national and local non-profit health and human
              services organizations, including Boston's Public Health
              Commission, Boston Medical Center's Board of Trustees, and various
              other high-performing organizations committed to improving overall
              health and wellness of families and communities.
            </div>
            <span
              class="hidden md:block material-icons-outlined text-navy-900/20 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors"
              >north_east</span
            >
          </div>
          <div class="border-t border-navy-900/10"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto my-12">
          <div
            class="bg-gray-50 border border-navy-900/10 rounded-md px-6 py-8 mb-12"
          >
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy-900 mb-3">Greg Wilmot</h3>
            <p
              class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-navy-900/40 mb-4"
            >
              Founder & CEO
            </p>
            <p class="text-sm text-navy-900/60">
              Greg's broad experience – spanning hospitals, health plans,
              government, and community health – gives PrimePoint Health a 360°
              perspective on healthcare challenges. Under his leadership, our
              team combines strategic insight with operational know-how to
              deliver results for our clients.
            </p>

            <div class="mt-6 rounded-xl">
              <Image src={gregWilmot} alt="Greg Wilmot" width="660" height="528" class="mx-auto" />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Our Values Section -->
    <section class="py-20 px-4 bg-white">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
        <div class="text-center mb-16">
          <h2 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-8">Our Values</h2>
          <p class="text-xl text-gray-700 leading-relaxed max-w-4xl mx-auto">
            Our work is grounded in a set of core values that guide everything
            we do:
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
          <!-- Value 1 -->
          <div class="text-center space-y-4">
            <div
              class="w-20 h-20 bg-blue-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6"
            >
              <svg
                class="w-10 h-10 text-blue-600"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              >
                <path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Integrity</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
              We uphold the highest ethical standards, providing candid advice
              and acting in the best interests of our clients and their
              communities.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Value 2 -->
          <div class="text-center space-y-4">
            <div
              class="w-20 h-20 bg-blue-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6"
            >
              <svg
                class="w-10 h-10 text-blue-600"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              >
                <path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z"
                ></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Collaboration</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
              We believe in working with our clients, not just for them. Lasting
              change happens through partnership, active listening, and
              co-creation.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Value 3 -->
          <div class="text-center space-y-4">
            <div
              class="w-20 h-20 bg-blue-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6"
            >
              <svg
                class="w-10 h-10 text-blue-600"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              >
                <path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Innovation</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
              We constantly seek better ways to solve problems, encouraging
              creative thinking and embracing new approaches to healthcare's
              toughest challenges.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div
          class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 justify-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mt-12"
        >
          <!-- Value 4 -->
          <div class="text-center space-y-4">
            <div
              class="w-20 h-20 bg-blue-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6"
            >
              <svg
                class="w-10 h-10 text-blue-600"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              >
                <path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z"
                ></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Equity</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
              We are committed to advancing health equity. Every strategy we
              recommend aims to improve access, outcomes, and fairness for all
              populations.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Value 5 -->
          <div class="text-center space-y-4">
            <div
              class="w-20 h-20 bg-blue-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6"
            >
              <svg
                class="w-10 h-10 text-blue-600"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              >
                <path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Excellence</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
              We strive for quality and excellence in our deliverables,
              analysis, and recommendations – focused on achieving meaningful,
              measurable impact.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Final Statement Section -->
    <section class="py-20 px-4 bg-navy-900 text-center">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <p class="text-xl text-white/80 leading-relaxed mb-8">
          When you work with PrimePoint Health, you gain a partner who shares
          your mission and will go the extra mile to ensure success. Our
          clients' goals become our goals, and we measure our achievements by
          the improvements we help bring to life.
        </p>
        <a
          href="#"
          class="bg-primary text-navy-900 font-extrabold uppercase tracking-widest px-10 py-4 rounded-sm hover:brightness-110 transition-all text-xs inline-block"
        >
          Get Started
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
